  "title": "Puerto Rican Gazpacho Salad",
  "description": "This Puerto Rican gazpacho salad recipe uses salted codfish to bring a briny taste of the ocean to a mixture of avocado, onion, and tomato.",
  "authors": [
    "Chef Victor A Rodriguez"
  ],
